<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia O'Connor's year net up 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia O'Connor's year net up 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		22.08	 vs	 21.13</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     52.0	  vs	 49.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 239.81	 vs	200.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  31.94	 vs	 30.42</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	12.0	  vs	 12.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is O'Connor's Corp Bhd. It was previously known as O'Connor's Engineering &amp; Trading (M) Bhd. It sells telecommunications products and distributes electronic and consumer products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
